Embedded SHA-256: 6eb5434931cf41e27aa62ebb684b682b0b0b7a0f014d954c00e00c3802906f92
Embedded entries: 3000

Selection: Read the pinned top-one-million list in published order, split on
LF only, decode each record as strict UTF-8, retain records with 15 through 128
Unicode code points, remove exact duplicates, and stop after 3000 records.
No trimming, case folding, or Unicode normalization is performed. Join the
selected records with LF and include a final LF. The complete source contains
5406 unique records that satisfy the length policy.

This is a public dictionary, not customer credentials. No customer password
or derived hash is sent to the source or any remote service. Runtime checks
use only the embedded dictionary. This snapshot establishes the scoped
ASVS 5.0.0 6.2.4 common-password check; it does not claim coverage of every
breached password or every authentication flow elsewhere in the application.

